{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25562","headline":"春山三朅来 三 · 李涉","name":"春山三朅来 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采药朅来药苗盛，药生只傍行人径。\n世人重耳不重目，指似药苗心不足。\n野客住山三十载，妻儿共寄浮云外。\n小男学语便分别，已辩君臣知匹配。\n都市广长开大铺，疾来求者多相悞。\n见说韩康旧姓名，识之不识先相怒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}